xed mb-6","children":"The adoption of Marketing Automation has accelerated massively across India. Consumers now expect businesses to be available instantly on their preferred platforms. The shift from one-way broadcasting to two-way conversational commerce is the defining trend of the year, driven by higher internet penetration and digital comfort."}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","1",{"id":"section-1","className":"mb-12 scroll-mt-32","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-gray-100","children":"Key Insights and Data Points"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":"Recent industry reports show that businesses actively employing Marketing Automation strategies witness a 60% higher retention rate. Furthermore, WhatsApp boasts an unparalleled open rate of 98%, making it the undisputed champion for delivering high-impact messages and securing customer attention in a crowded market."}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","2",{"id":"section-2","className":"mb-12 scroll-mt-32","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-gray-100","children":"Practical Implementation Strategy"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":"A successful Marketing Automation strategy requires a phased approach. Start by auditing your current customer touchpoints. Then, identify bottlenecks where automation or personalized messaging can add value. Finally, design conversational flows that guide the user naturally from discovery to purchase and post-sales support."}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","3",{"id":"section-3","className":"mb-12 scroll-mt-32","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-gray-100","children":"Tools and Resources You Need"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":"To execute this effectively, you need a robust platform. Waki offers everything required for a sophisticated Marketing Automation strategy, including an official WhatsApp Business API integration, a no-code chatbot builder, granular analytics, and seamless CRM integrations, all from a single dashboard."}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","4",{"id":"section-4","className":"mb-12 scroll-mt-32","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-gray-100","children":"Common Pitfalls and How to Avoid Them"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":"Many businesses fail by treating WhatsApp like traditional email — blasting generic messages to their entire list. To avoid high block rates and account bans, focus on explicit opt-ins, highly segmented targeting, and providing genuine value in every interaction rather than purely promotional content."}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","5",{"id":"section-5","className":"mb-12 scroll-mt-32","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-gray-100","children":"Action Plan for the Next 30 Days"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":"Over the next month, focus on migrating your top 20% most active customers to your new WhatsApp channel. Use Waki to set up a welcome series and a basic FAQ bot. Monitor engagement metrics closely and iterate your messaging templates based on what drives the highest response rates."}],"$undefined"]}]],["$","hr",null,{"className":"my-12 border-gray-200"}],["$","section",null,{"id":"faqs","className":"mb-12 scroll-mt-32","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6","children":"Frequently Asked Questions"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-gray-100","children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"font-bold text-lg text-gray-900 mb-2","children":"Why is a dedic